Defender of Freedom       Prometeo         1   275   None
  As the Defender of Freedom, Prometeo leads the Neutral Kingdoms in their 
quest for a free world.  The Mercenaries Guild has thrown in their lot with 
Prometeo, and will allow hiss kingdom to recruit mercenaries for just one 
gold (although maintenance costs remain normal).  When mercenary units 
wander, they will tend to work their way towards his kingdom.  Also, when he 
is the supreme commander at a battle, one unit in the front line, chosen at 
random, will be joined by a band of berserking freedom fighters and become 
fanatical.

